<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Airlines workers end three-day strike.</title>
<headline>Philippine Airlines workers end three-day strike.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Striking ground crew of Philippine Airlines (PAL) agreed on Saturday to end their three-day strike and return to work on Sunday, the airline said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the two parties had signed an agreement to work out a new wage package before November 21. The strike was sparked by union wage and job security demands.</p>
</text>
